        Root cause:
        The bug occurs because the preempt delay kernel thread may still be executing when the module is removed, leading to a potential crash as the thread could be running after its code has been unloaded. This situation is exacerbated on slower machines where the execution time of the thread may exceed the time taken to unload the module.

        Commit message:
